# Keep the build context small and make sure host artifacts never leak into the image.
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
**/build
**/dist
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/__screenshots__
.git
.github
.claude
.vscode
.idea

# Secrets and local config
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Not needed to build
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
**/*.md
docs
**/e2e
**/playwright.config.ts

# Never copy a private price book into a build context
**/prices*.yaml
**/prices*.yml
